{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 38","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A farmer sold <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> hogs for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/6/e6607fa58d5e1be0cc074e9cc12b35f0046662f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2030.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" /> Some were sold for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/2/a22960968e6c093c4eae61303577e4f90fd4051c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$ 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" />, and the remainder were sold for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/6/1f640f8e89d75373bf19c9603218e544c80e2854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$ 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" /> each. How many were sold at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/2/a22960968e6c093c4eae61303577e4f90fd4051c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$ 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> each?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bb2fc36e9dbd8083857f02e313c5dea92d021e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad 37; \\quad \\text{(B)} \\quad 19; \\quad \\text{(C)} \\quad 29; \\quad \\text{(D)} \\quad 42; \\quad \\text{(E)} \\quad \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"474\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If there were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> hogs sold at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> dollars each, then there were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/7/9d73495206f019b896ab0782a90089a6a71100b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60-h$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" /> hogs sold at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> dollars each. Using this, we can construct an equation which lets us solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />, the number of hogs sold at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> dollars each.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/0/7401788c15721ad9f3b51c8791134f8aafe6e09a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[30h + 40(60-h) = 2030\\]\" width=\"193\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/d/e1d569ddf42160962371e03ebcd16364d1c9c683.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[30h - 40h + 2400 = 2030\\]\" width=\"197\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/3/fa3fa8be5ff091f39eec9f7a8561aab8e4148aa6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-10h = -370\\]\" width=\"106\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/5/a55859292fd1a11d49025a3255abad23d43f67f0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[h = \\frac{-370}{-10} = 37.\\]\" width=\"125\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><br />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/1/0c1c9d1b1e9b85d185f077bab73eb0531dd6f2e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"37\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_37\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 37\"> Problem 37</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_39\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 39\">Problem 39</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018041646\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.018 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 114/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 661/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 305/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3068/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.774      1 Template:Succession_box\n100.00%    6.774      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20684:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018041646 and revision id 144661. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}